; MoneyDancer 2.0 — XAUUSD WT (with-trend) ship-config
; Date: 2026-05-18 (upgraded from S17 -> WT after S3.2b validation)
;
; Validated on full 17-month sweep (Jan 2025 - May 2026, 2-week cells, 5k):
;   17/17 cells positive (vs 12/17 with S17)
;   Arithmetic mean +63.8% / cell  (S17 was +31.3%)
;   Geometric mean   +53.4% / cell  (S17 was +24.8%)
;   Worst cell      +0.6%          (S17 was -19.8%)
;   Max DD           37.1%          (S17 was 33.7%)
;   Daily-avg        +6.38%/day     (S17 was +3.13%/day; both above target band)
;   Total net (17 × $5k) +$54,219   (2.04x S17's +$26,622)
;
; Validated on Apr 1-10 2026 100k linear-scaling check (S17 config):
;   Net +96.3% / Eq DD 14.8% — confirms linear scaling holds
;
; Rails enabled in this .set:
;   S1.0  per-basket equity SL (8% cap, 2/day pause)
;   S1.5  auto-scaled LotsBase (0.002 per $1000 -> 0.01@5k / 0.20@100k / 0.40@200k)
;   S1.6  all-time peak-to-trough DD trailing kill (40%)
;   S1.7  Friday end-of-week flatten (20:00 server)
;   S3.2a MMD multi-cloud regime classifier (HARD mode)
;   S3.2b WITH_TREND-only grid (new: allow trend-aligned baskets in MMD-trend)
;
; Rails explicitly disabled (tested, currently over-restrictive):
;   S1.1 news-blackout  — killed Apr-2025 -73pp. Awaits per-event safety classification.
;   S1.4 spread-spike   — over-restrictive on Duka feeds; revisit with live RB spreads.
;   S2.0 hour-block     — killed monthly mean. Revisit per-hour by regime.
;   S1.3 daily-loss kill — optional; set MaxDailyLossPct=15 if you want it
;
; Notes on live deployment:
;   - MaxSpreadPts=100 is calibrated for Duka spread overlay.
;     On live RoboForex Pro (median ~25), lower to ~50 (still well above p95 ~35).
;     The OOS-2025 backtests used 100; matching that for ship .set.
;   - LotsBasePerThousand=0.002 is the scale-portable lot anchor.
;     Live equity 5000 -> 0.01 lot. 100000 -> 0.20 lot. 200000 -> 0.40 lot.
;     If you prefer fixed lots, set LotsBasePerThousand=0 and LotsBase=<value>.

